Qwen Code Termux is a porting/distribution fork of Qwen Code for Android
ARM64 (Termux). It carries only the Android/Termux compatibility delta
needed to package and run upstream Qwen Code on Termux. These compatibility
patches are maintained by Davide A. Guglielmi and distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 together with the upstream Qwen Code codebase.

Upstream project: https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code
